# Testing

## Requirements

- Every behavior change needs tests.
- The full suite must remain green (`make test` / `make check`).
- Bug fixes require a regression test that fails before the fix when practical.

## Constraints

- Prefer local, deterministic tests.
- No network / OpenAI calls unless the task explicitly requires network integration tests.
- Avoid flaky timing or order-dependent assertions.

## Scope

- Unit tests for pure logic and contracts.
- Integration-style tests for persistence/tools may use temporary SQLite.
- Do not weaken architecture or safety tests to make a change pass.
